<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Reasoning Generation Template</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We carefully design a <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">reasoning generation template</span> that guides the model to generate step-by-step reasoning in a consistent and structured format for our benchmark’s reasoning annotations:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.06067v1/prompt_template.png" id="A1.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:439/419;" width="439" height="419" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Our prompt template.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
